{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他还拿那个决定逼自己向前，怕一停又退回等待，可曾尝到的亲近与欢喜让他舍不得放下。\",\n      \"key\": \"逼自己向前\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"text\": \"一难受，他就认定是自己又在退缩，非得把这股难受压过去才肯停。\",\n      \"key\": \"压过难受\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他拿当初的决心逼自己不许示弱，连疲惫都当成不争气。\",\n      \"key\": \"不许示弱\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他看见自己已经累得撑不住，还在逼自己硬撑，终于不愿再证明自己能扛。\",\n      \"key\": \"逼自己硬撑\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他松开对自己的逼迫，心里仍没踏实，却终于肯承认自己舍不得。\",\n      \"key\": \"承认舍不得\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时也不知道该怎么办，只知道自己想过上亲近、安心的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"亲近安心\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R18\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留那个决定曾让他走出犹豫、所以舍不得放手的原因；把怕失望说明变心改成怕停下又退回等待，并保留亲近与欢喜对他的牵引。跨段箭头改指S04-1，因为决定曾让他从犹豫中动起来，才是他害怕停下的直接前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R19\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把痛苦误认成迟疑、非要克服才能停下的心理机制，删去重复的怕辜负最初决意。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R20\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留坚定的要求逐渐变成苛责，把不容许脆弱具体写成不许示弱、把疲惫当成不争气。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R21\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他从持续逼迫走到疲惫极限的转折，改成他看见自己已经撑不住还在硬撑，去掉工整反转和空泛的自我证明。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R22\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留停止催逼后仍未安心的状态，把依恋获得空间具体写成他终于肯承认舍不得。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R23\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S05-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留松懈后的茫然与承认不舍，把抽象的责任与依恋对照具体化为亲近、安心的生活愿望，接向S06。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cfe3c5e0-3187-4c56-aba9-1d3d57dc980b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T074333685644Z", "elapsed_seconds": 224.094, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T07:47:17.803215+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d7f917e9e137f927b1a3dd22ffab527e14e2e450074ab350688ddd8556dc86b6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": 